niraluli (0.81-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Tamil-0.81 release.
  * File I/O: seek, mkdir, readdir, chmod (கோப்பு).
  * Time: RFC3339 parse, UTC/Local format, timers/tickers (நேரம்).
  * HTTP: dial/connect timeout and relative redirect Location.
  * SQL: PostgreSQL backend via libpq dlopen (தரவுத்தளம்).
  * Package bundles portable Go 1.22; gcc/clang still required to run builds.

